OL,3,GNEWSARailway station gets
OL,4,Aheritage-inspired overhaul
OL,5,
OL,6,FA railway station has been overhauled
OL,7,Fto acknowledge its heritage in an
OL,8,F#835,000 refit.
OL,10,FThe waiting room and ticket office at
OL,11,FCastle Cary Station in Somerset has
OL,12,Fbeen refitted in a classic style, its
OL,13,Foriginal entrance has reopened and a
OL,14,Fnew ramp for wheelchair-users has been
OL,15,Finstalled.
OL,17,FMore seating has been put in on the
OL,18,Fplatform, along with a digital
OL,19,Fdeparture board and larger toilet and
OL,20,Fbaby-changing facilities.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
