OL,3,GNEWSARailway station gets
OL,4,Aheritage-inspired overhaul
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project was funded by the
OL,7,Fgovernment, which provided #560,000,
OL,8,Ftogether with #275,000 from the Railway
OL,9,FHeritage Trust, which aims to maintain
OL,10,Fand preserve the historic features of
OL,11,FBritish railways.
